<p align=3D"CENTER"><font face=3D"Arial">POR FATO N=C3O CRIMINOSO</font></p=
>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 35px">
<span style=3D"color: black; font-weight: normal">
		<a name=3D"art549"></a></span><font face=3D"Arial">Art.&nbsp;549.&nbsp;&n=
bsp;Se a autoridade policial tiver conhecimento de fato que, embora n=E3o=
=20
constituindo infra=E7=E3o penal, possa determinar a aplica=E7=E3o de medida=
 de seguran=E7a=20
(<a href=3D"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/decreto-lei/Del2848.htm#a=
rt14.">C=F3digo Penal, arts. 14</a> e<a href=3D"https://www.planalto.gov.br=
/ccivil_03/decreto-lei/Del2848.htm#art27.">=20
27</a>), dever=E1 proceder a inqu=E9rito, a fim de apur=E1-lo e averiguar t=
odos os=20
elementos que possam interessar =E0 verifica=E7=E3o da periculosidade do ag=
ente.</font></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 35px">
<span style=3D"color: black; font-weight: normal">
		<a name=3D"art550"></a></span><font face=3D"Arial">Art.&nbsp;550.&nbsp;&n=
bsp;O processo ser=E1 promovido pelo Minist=E9rio P=FAblico, mediante=20
