vistos no
<a href=3D"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/decreto-lei/Del2848.htm#ar=
t14.">art.&nbsp;14</a> ou no <a href=3D"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_=
03/decreto-lei/Del2848.htm#art27.">
art.&nbsp;27 do C=F3digo Penal</a>, aplicar-lhe-=E1, se for caso, medida de=
 seguran=E7a.</font></p>

