<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 35px"><font face=3D"Arial">
III&nbsp;-&nbsp;quando quem ordenar a coa=E7=E3o n=E3o tiver compet=EAncia =
para faz=EA-lo;</font></p>

<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 35px"><font face=3D"Arial">
