<p align=3D"JUSTIFY" style=3D"text-indent: 35px">
<span style=3D"color: black; font-weight: normal">
		<a name=3D"art650"></a></span><font face=3D"Arial">Art.&nbsp;650.&nbsp;&n=
bsp;Competir=E1 conhecer, originariamente, do pedido de <b>habeas corpus</b=
